{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"43656a1ff2b81750","x":-1420,"y":-700,"width":420,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"God of the Hells Asmodeus is the most foul evil creature to have ever existed\n"},
		{"id":"de5b1a7e41c4ebae","x":-1420,"y":-600,"width":660,"height":180,"type":"text","text":"Lord of the Hells, Asmodeus. God of domination, torture and the ruler of the nine hells. He was the only God in the war to strike a defining blow on Pelor but he paid gravely for it. Being left to rot in a domain of Pelor's creation to be tortured eternally. His followers ensue chaos wherever they go and are nearly all torturers. His dominion over the hells has created a massive army which he hopes to one day unleash on the world now that the Gods have left mortals to fend for themselves.\n"},
		{"id":"e93a0fa6218f6131","x":-720,"y":-820,"width":900,"height":520,"type":"text","text":"The reasons Asmodeus wants to invade the world and the reasons he cannot. \n\n\nAsmodeus wants to rule the entirety of the planes created by the Prime Deities but is currently shackled and imprisoned in the bottom of the 9 hells and is in a battle with the demons of the abyss. Asmodeus wants to bring order to the cosmos and rule over it with an iron fist and the demons of the abyss represent chaos and unlawful evil. Because of this he believes it is his armies sworn duty to fight in a never ending blood war on the realm of Avernus to combat against unlawful chaos. \n\nThis constant war puts a strain on his armies and the battle is forever at a stand still. Because of this war he and his armies have not been able to advance to another plane outside of the hells. \n\nWhen the Raven Queen ascended to God hood and created The Dreamers Heart Asmodeus saw a chance to gain power capable enough to destroy the abyss and rule over the cosmos finally being lifted of his eternal damnation. \n\nAnd so Asmodeus sent pit fiends and other devils a like in an attempt to kidnap those who hold the Lumiere bloodline and turn them into a weapon of war. However he failed and was stopped by The Champion of Ravens.\n\nWith Aralia Lumiere awakening the power within her Asmodeus finally located another descendant of the Lumiere and this time will not fail. \n\nAs of right now Asmodeus is making a deal with Verazanoth. Verazanoth will be granted an army and will be entrusted with the ruler of Avernus Zariel the fallen angel.\n"},
		{"id":"ee0ba7168f42abae","x":-643,"y":-200,"width":823,"height":200,"type":"text","text":"Zariel arch devil and right hand of Asmodeus\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ETZEN72H8Ac\n\nThat video will be a very close actual representation of Zariel \n\nAnd this story took place during the Divergence \n\n\nZariels current elite force is called The Burning Hand\n"},
		{"id":"2258661156890d16","type":"text","text":"[[Betrayer Gods.canvas]]\n[[Aralia Lumiere.canvas]]\n#Betrayer ","x":-1420,"y":-900,"width":300,"height":80}
	],
	"edges":[]
}